# Room 14: the GPU Field. Graphics cards grow in rows like corn, on both
# sides of a lane. Right of the lane stands a trellis that looks like the
# axes of a chart with nothing on it. The beanstalk (a view) grows along
# it, up and to the right, into the Cloud in the top right corner.
# Generated once from a loop, then kept by hand: edit freely.

